  "body": "Found while gating the #3216 PR (PR #3617) on 2026-11-23. The suite is red on a checkout where no file of that PR's diff is touched.\n\n## What happens\n\nThe `docs_troubleshooting` suite of `camcraft-app` greps a refusal message stem. The stem spans a line-continued string in `crates/sim/src/verify` (the source string is split across lines, so the grep for the single-line stem does not match). The suite is red for that reason alone.\n\n## What the fix needs\n\n- Either the test normalizes the source (joins the line-continued string) before it greps, or the message stem it greps matches one physical line of the source.\n- The same pattern check is owed to any sibling suite that greps a message across a possible string continuation.\n\n## Done means\n\n- `app suites: docs_troubleshooting` is green on a clean checkout of `main`.\n\nObserved on a Windows checkout; independent of line-ending settings.\n",
